<div style="background-color: #FAF8F5; padding: 4rem 0;">
  <div class="page-width" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5%;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">Find answers to our most common queries below. If you can't find what you're looking for, please contact our support team.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; gap: 2rem;">
      
      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">What is your return policy?</h3>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">We accept returns within 30 days of purchase. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and have original tags attached. Final sale items cannot be returned or exchanged.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">How long does shipping take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Standard domestic shipping takes 3-5 business days. Express shipping options are available at checkout and typically arrive within 1-2 business days. International shipping varies by destination.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Do you ship internationally?</h3>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Yes! We ship to over 100 countries worldwide. Shipping costs and delivery times are calculated at checkout based on your location.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">How do I track my order?</h3>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Once your order ships, you will receive a confirmation email with a tracking link. You can also log into your Velour account to view your order history and real-time tracking updates.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: #fff; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Are your fabrics sustainably sourced?</h3>
        <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">Sustainability is at the core of our brand. Over 80% of our collections use organic, recycled, or low-impact materials. Visit our Sustainability page for more details.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;">
      <p style="color: #666; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Still need help?</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="button" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #000; color: #fff; padding: 1rem 3rem; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">Contact Support</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQs",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
